Subject: [PATCH] test(ci): refresh prompt-surface tool_tokens left stale by
 c51212b4d0

c51212b4d0 changed the browser_exec schema; the per-tool files were
updated but surfaces.json kept the old tool_tokens, so
tests/ci/test_prompt_surface.py is red on main and on every PR. Only the
nine tool_tokens counts change (+47/+48); no prompt or schema text moves.
